{
  "id": "630",
  "title": "Preparing Documents For A Visa",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2018-12-07",
  "synopsis": "Feifei is overwhelmed by all the documents needed to apply for a visa.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/911/2b8cf2fe2249a33ed15ab66df1e6e262a8e732a0.mp3?1575020879",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我在准备签证材料\n\n李飞飞：唉……真麻烦！\n陈一诺：怎么了？\n李飞飞：我在准备申请泰国签证要用的材料，太多了，真麻烦！\n陈一诺：你可以让旅行社代办呀。\n李飞飞：代办也一样要准备材料啊。\n陈一诺：代办的话有时候不需要准备那么多材料的，你可以去问问。我上次去泰国，旅行社就只要我提供了护照和身份证，不到两天签证就下来了。\n李飞飞：真的吗？那我改天去看看。",
    "traditional": "我在準備簽證材料\n\n李飛飛：唉……真麻煩！\n陳一諾：怎麼了？\n李飛飛：我在準備申請泰國簽證要用的材料，太多了，真麻煩！\n陳一諾：你可以讓旅行社代辦呀。\n李飛飛：代辦也一樣要準備材料啊。\n陳一諾：代辦的話有時候不需要準備那麼多材料的，你可以去問問。我上次去泰國，旅行社就只要我提供了護照和身份證，不到兩天簽證就下來了。\n李飛飛：真的嗎？那我改天去看看。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I’m Preparing Documents For A Visa"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "李飞飞：唉……真麻烦！",
      "traditional": "李飛飛：唉……真麻煩！",
      "pinyin": "lǐ fēi fēi ài zhēn má fan",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li Feifei: Ugh… It’s so much work!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "陈一诺：怎么了？",
      "traditional": "陳一諾：怎麼了？",
      "pinyin": "chén yī nuò zěn me le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Chen Yinuo: What’s the matter?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "李飞飞：我在准备申请泰国签证要用的材料，太多了，真麻烦！",
      "traditional": "李飛飛：我在準備申請泰國簽證要用的材料，太多了，真麻煩！",
      "pinyin": "lǐ fēi fēi wǒ zài zhǔn bèi shēn qǐng tài guó qiān zhèng yào yòng de cái liào tài duō le zhēn má fan",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li Feifei: I’m currently preparing the documents needed to apply for a Thai visa. It’s too much. It’s so much trouble!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "陈一诺：你可以让旅行社代办呀。",
      "traditional": "陳一諾：你可以讓旅行社代辦呀。",
      "pinyin": "chén yī nuò nǐ kě yǐ ràng lǚ xíng shè dài bàn ya",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Chen Yinuo: You can have a travel agency do it for you."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "李飞飞：代办也一样要准备材料啊。",
      "traditional": "李飛飛：代辦也一樣要準備材料啊。",
      "pinyin": "lǐ fēi fēi dài bàn yě yí yàng yào zhǔn bèi cái liào a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li Feifei: Even if I use an agent, I still have to prepare documents in the same way."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "陈一诺：代办的话有时候不需要准备那么多材料的，",
      "traditional": "陳一諾：代辦的話有時候不需要準備那麼多材料的，",
      "pinyin": "chén yī nuò dài bàn de huà yǒu shí hou bù xū yào zhǔn bèi nà me duō cái liào de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "你可以去问问。",
      "traditional": "你可以去問問。",
      "pinyin": "nǐ kě yǐ qù wèn wen",
      "english": "Chen Yinuo: When you use an agent, sometimes you don’t need to prepare that many documents."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "我上次去泰国，旅行社就只要我提供了护照和身份证，",
      "traditional": "我上次去泰國，旅行社就只要我提供了護照和身份證，",
      "pinyin": "wǒ shàng cì qù tài guó lǚ xíng shè jiù zhǐ yào wǒ tí gōng le hù zhào hé shēn fèn zhèng",
      "english": "You can go and ask."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "不到两天签证就下来了。",
      "traditional": "不到兩天簽證就下來了。",
      "pinyin": "bú dào liǎng tiān qiān zhèng jiù xià lai le",
      "english": "When I went to Thailand last time, the travel agency only asked me to supply my passport and ID card."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I got the visa in less than two days."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "李飞飞：真的吗？那我改天去看看。",
      "traditional": "李飛飛：真的嗎？那我改天去看看。",
      "pinyin": "lǐ fēi fēi zhēn de ma nà wǒ gǎi tiān qù kàn kan",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li Feifei: Really? Then I’ll go ask another day."
    }
  ],
