    "sentence_translations": [
      "I’m Preparing Documents For A Visa",
      "",
      "Li Feifei: Ugh… It’s so much work!",
      "",
      "Chen Yinuo: What’s the matter?",
      "",
      "Li Feifei: I’m currently preparing the documents needed to apply for a Thai visa. It’s too much. It’s so much trouble!",
      "",
      "Chen Yinuo: You can have a travel agency do it for you.",
      "",
      "Li Feifei: Even if I use an agent, I still have to prepare documents in the same way.",
      "",
      "Chen Yinuo: When you use an agent, sometimes you don’t need to prepare that many documents.",
      "You can go and ask.",
      "When I went to Thailand last time, the travel agency only asked me to supply my passport and ID card.",
      "I got the visa in less than two days.",
      "",
      "Li Feifei: Really? Then I’ll go ask another day.",
      ""
    ]
